# The comprehensive user-guide vault ships with a versioned `quickstart`
# theme, so whitelist its source through the global `.ztl/` ignore.
# Everything else under user-guide/.ztl/ stays ignored (index.json,
# search/, jj/, history/ are all cache and regenerate on first run).
!user-guide/.ztl/
user-guide/.ztl/*
!user-guide/.ztl/themes/
